---
import { Heading } from 'accessible-astro-components'
---

<section class="my-48">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="mb-12 max-w-4xl">
      <Heading level="h2" class="mb-4">What I Bring</Heading>

      <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed">
        A combination of project discipline, analytical thinking,
        technical fluency, and operational experience focused on moving
        complex work toward measurable outcomes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-t pt-6">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">
          Project Management &amp; Structured Execution
        </h3>

        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Turn broad objectives into organized, controllable work.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm font-semibold">
          Requirements • Scope • Scheduling • Risk • Stakeholders • Change Control
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-t pt-6">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">
          Business Analysis &amp; Process Improvement
        </h3>

        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Clarify what needs to happen, why it matters, and how the process can work better.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm font-semibold">
          Requirements Analysis • Process Improvement • Workflow Design • Decision Rules
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-t pt-6">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">
          Analytics &amp; Decision Support
        </h3>

        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Use data to understand performance, identify patterns, and support better decisions.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm font-semibold">
          KPIs • Forecasting • Dashboards • Data Visualization • Operational Analysis
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-t pt-6">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">
          Technical &amp; Data Fluency
        </h3>

        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Work directly with data and technical tools while keeping the business objective in view.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm font-semibold">
          Python • SQL • pandas • Jupyter • Git/GitHub
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-t pt-6 md:col-span-2">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">
          Operations &amp; Cross-Functional Execution
        </h3>

        <p class="max-w-4xl text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Move work forward when information, resources, and priorities are imperfect.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm font-semibold">
          Operations • Resource Prioritization • Vendor Coordination • Risk Evaluation • Execution
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>